Instead

> lm(y~x)

Call:
lm(formula = y ~ x)

Coefficients:
(Intercept)            x  
    0.08079      4.65938

try

lm(y~x-1)

Call:
lm(formula = y ~ x - 1)

Coefficients:
    x  
