Dear David

Although Yellow Dog is a RedHat based port to the Mac, S-Plus
will not work, because there is simply no binary for the
PowerPC processor used in the Mac!! S-Plus is only compiled
for Intel processors (and other processors mentioned by Brian
Ripley), but not for the PowerPC (sorrowly) used in the Mac.
Yellow Dog could port RedHat Linux from the Intel processor
to the PowerPC processor, because the source code is free.
However, this is not true for S-Plus (no source code, since
it is a commercial package!)

Best regards
