Splus 2000 Programmers? Guide- Chapter 22 Using Less Time and Memory. 

- to see if you can improve the programming statements that takes a lot
of time. 

If this does not seem to make a lot of difference I would recommend you
to have a look at Tim Hesterberg?s guide to Efficient Programming in
S-PLUS. This covers many finer details about how to make your simulation
runs faster, and in my case the section on "Generate random numbers many
at a time" improved my time substantially! Thank you Tim!

