Subject: Re: round function - help
Message-ID: <70E1C0DB4F9B5E4F9CEDB8433F4A68B901873F8D@PSBMAIL2>

For what it's worth, neither round nor floor, pushed to extremes, will do
exactly what one would want, doubtless a/c of machine rep problems:

floor(3.4999999999999+.5)   
[1] 3                                   --- this one is OK, but:

> floor(3.49999999999999999999999+.5)
[1] 4
> round(3.49999999999999999999999)
[1] 4
> floor(2.49999999999999999999999+.5)
[1] 3
> round(2.49999999999999999999999) 

[1] 2                                            OK, but
> round(2.500000000000000000000000001)
[1] 2

