Dear All,

Thanks you Nick and Tim for your extremely fast responses! 

Perhaps the easiest way is to do: 

as.data.frame.array(junk,row.dims=1:3)

Maybe there ought to be as.data.frame.matrix, as.data.frame.table etc..!

To add the matrices inside an array, I propose to cbind the matrices and
index them with reference numbers to do rowSums or coSums as required. 

Steve. 

