From ripley at stats.ox.ac.uk  Mon Dec 23 14:40:37 2002
From: ripley at stats.ox.ac.uk
Date: Mon, 23 Dec 2002 14:40:37 +0000
Subject: Re: retrieving call arguments from a list
In-Reply-To: <2AD55759A5B6D611BBEE009027DE79611979A5@icex2.cc.ic.ac.uk>
References: <2AD55759A5B6D611BBEE009027DE79611979A5@icex2.cc.ic.ac.uk>
Message-ID: <Pine.LNX.4.31.0212231437530.6111-100000@gannet.stats>

Use lapply on the list of names, not the objects. Something like

lapply(names(subjects), function(x) f(subjects[[x]]))

or

lapply(names(subjects), function(x) {nm <- x; f(subjects[[x]], nm)})

