The new bootstrap code supports this.
For example, if you've defined an lm object:
        fit _ lm(Fuel ~ Weight, data=fuel.frame)
this bootstraps the coefficients using samples of size 50:
        bootstrap(fit, coef, sampler=samp.MonteCarlo(size=50))

